<title>AUSTRALIA: Healthscope sells hospital for A$10.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Healthscope sells hospital for A$10.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian hospital group Healthscope Ltd said on Wednesday it had sold Mildura Private Hospital to a hospital fund for A$10.7 million cash.</p>
<p>The proceeds would be used to reduce debt and help fund the group's restructuring programme, Healthscope said.</p>
<p>The sale, to Mildura District Hospital Fund, was in line with the hospital's current valuation, it added.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne bureau 61-3 9286-1421</p>
